        </div>
        <div class="accordion" id="faqAccordion">
            <div class="accordion-item">
                <h2 class="accordion-header" id="faq1">
                    <button class="accordion-button" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#collapse1">
                        Can we add multiple team members with different access levels?
                    </button>
                </h2>
                <div id="collapse1" class="accordion-collapse collapse show" data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion">
                    <div class="accordion-body">
                        Yes. The CA Firm Plan allows unlimited users with role-based permissions – Admin (full control), CA (create/edit invoices but not delete firm settings), and Staff (view only or create drafts). This ensures proper separation of duties.
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="accordion-item">
                <h2 class="accordion-header" id="faq2">
                    <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#collapse2">
                        How does bulk invoice generation work?
                    </button>
                </h2>
                <div id="collapse2" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion">
                    <div class="accordion-body">
                        You prepare a CSV file with columns: client name, GSTIN, service description, quantity, rate, HSN/SAC, tax rate, etc. Upload it to RatPDF, and we generate one PDF invoice per client. You can download individual or batch zip files.
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="accordion-item">
                <h2 class="accordion-header" id="faq3">
                    <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#collapse3">
                        Is the client database secure?
                    </button>
                </h2>
                <div id="collapse3" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion">
                    <div class="accordion-body">
                        Absolutely. We use bank-level encryption (AES-256) for stored data, and all connections are HTTPS. Your firm's data is isolated and never shared. You can also export your entire client database at any time.
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="accordion-item">
                <h2 class="accordion-header" id="faq4">
                    <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#collapse4">
                        Can we set up recurring retainers for different clients?
                    </button>
                </h2>
                <div id="collapse4" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion">
                    <div class="accordion-body">
                        Yes. For each client, you can define a recurring schedule (monthly, quarterly, annually) with a fixed amount. On the scheduled date, the system creates a draft invoice for partner review and approval before sending.
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="accordion-item">
                <h2 class="accordion-header" id="faq5">
                    <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#collapse5">
                        Is there a free trial for the CA Firm Plan?
                    </button>
                </h2>
                <div id="collapse5" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion">
                    <div class="accordion-body">
